ManageReentrancy_Integration_Concrete_Test
├── when a managed call reenters manage through a different adapter
│  └── it should revert with ReentrancyGuardReentrantCall
├── when a managed call reenters manage through the same adapter
│  └── it should revert with ReentrancyGuardReentrantCall
└── when a single managed swap does not reenter
   └── it should succeed and credit the vault
